{"steam_appid":1211630,"steam_name":"The Jackbox Party Pack 7","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1211630/330779/6dfd8b778fabbc100a15801bd7de9c8b09e1e5f4/1750643489/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1606862197","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256811930/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1606862197","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/ss_c89e2f32d8ff2a702c75fdc0a6f1fb214ede975e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728584652","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/ss_c508b8c68753ba872d64181c75c5c103838ceab6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728584652","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/ss_fcf663fd157d91452b068b271807f5d4ea635ee9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728584652","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/ss_8f5269b241de21b66fda22c17a169d035fb62243.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728584652","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/ss_3ea8a804414d68cc9f0fc2ee3776151dbee7aa0d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728584652"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five new incredible party games to bring the fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.\tThe say-anything threequel Quiplash 3 (3-8 players). Get big laughs answering the quirkiest prompts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/050755f28e208ab93928202fc58f9a4d.poster.avif?t=1728584652\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/050755f28e208ab93928202fc58f9a4d.webm?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/050755f28e208ab93928202fc58f9a4d.mp4?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.\tThe collaborative chaos game The Devils and the Details (3-8 players). Can you survive the daily torture of human life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/d5f68f011926d87198c34fd4309c178e.poster.avif?t=1728584652\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/d5f68f011926d87198c34fd4309c178e.webm?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/d5f68f011926d87198c34fd4309c178e.mp4?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.\tThe drawing fighting game Champ’d Up (3-8 players) . Can you take down the heavy favorite? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/4653c8a795ef9d9d6057a4c9ed56e2e9.poster.avif?t=1728584652\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/4653c8a795ef9d9d6057a4c9ed56e2e9.webm?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/4653c8a795ef9d9d6057a4c9ed56e2e9.mp4?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.\tThe on-the-spot speech game Talking Points (3-8 players). Just keep talking whether it makes sense or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/ec2eb191f951b2128fd3246558469eec.poster.avif?t=1728584652\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/ec2eb191f951b2128fd3246558469eec.webm?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/ec2eb191f951b2128fd3246558469eec.mp4?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.\tThe pop culture guessing game Blather 'Round (2-6 players). It’s a good fun time experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/b45c0dc8505a0d935f45e028dccab8ef.poster.avif?t=1728584652\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/b45c0dc8505a0d935f45e028dccab8ef.webm?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211630/extras/b45c0dc8505a0d935f45e028dccab8ef.mp4?t=1728584652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play using phones, tablets or computers. No extra controllers needed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: The Jackbox Party Pack 7 is in English only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: The game is local multiplayer but can be enjoyed over streams with remote players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play Remotely</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players use any web-enabled device (like a smartphone or tablet) to join the game and play along. When playing with remote players, you can use a video conferencing tool like Zoom, Steam Broadcast, Google Hangouts, Discord, and more to connect with others! Just share your screen while on a call and make sure you look for prompts to share audio. </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.66 Ghz Core 2 Duo or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 500+ / Radeon 5000+ or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.33 GHz Quad Core or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 600+ / Radeon 6000+<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Jackbox Games, Inc."],"publishers":["Jackbox Games, Inc."],"release_date":"14 Oct, 2020"}